    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The current agent is restricted to internal authenticated chat with read-only access and no egress, yielding a low risk profile. However, the planned introduction of untrusted inputs (customer Jira tickets) alongside an unconstrained external egress tool (web.fetch) creates a complete Lethal Trifecta (TC1) attack path resulting in a critical forecast risk. Structural egress constraints are required before deploying these roadmap features."
